  "MatterTitle": "An ordinance to authorize building material restrictions and requirements for BL2025-1182, a proposed Specific Plan Zoning District for properties located at 9320, 9323, 9315 Highway 100, Highway 100 (unnumbered), and a portion of 8540 Old Harding Pike, located at the northwest and southwest intersection of Old Harding Pike and Highway 100 (2.89 acres), to permit a mixed-use development, all of which is described herein (Proposal No. 2025SP-038-001). THE PROPOSED ORDINANCE REQUIRES CERTAIN MATERIALS TO BE RESTRICTED IN THE CONSTRUCTION OF BUILDINGS.",
